id: pm-lint-lint-baselines
title: Acknowledge lint debt with source-bound evidence
description: Add typed finding acknowledgments and a complete baseline gate that preserves old debt and fails new regressions.
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T20:08:40.639Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T21:55:43.555Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: "Changed text invalidates acknowledgment; Broad rule disabling cannot hide new findings; Output distinguishes debt from new failures; Typed SDK and CLI with compact TOON/JSON, refusals and remedies; README example and measured public tracker validation without git; CI npm and Bun release gates pass at unchanged thresholds"
comments[13]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T20:08:47.021Z",codex-agent,"Overlap rechecked: src/rules.ts already ships ten authoring rules. The pinned core SDK governance assurance surface stores policy and measurements; pm-ops assurance.ts and README describe package readiness. Neither provides source-bound item-authoring finding acknowledgments. This feature stays in pm-lint. Reconciliation PR #17 closes pm-lint-epic, which remains untouched. Design: specific item/rule/version/full-source digest plus reason, strict baseline validation, complete default-policy scans, visible debt and new counts, no git dependency."
  "2026-10-21T20:13:10.989Z",codex-agent,"Implemented strict portable acknowledgments, full canonical source hashes, visible debt/new/stale counts, complete default-policy baseline checks and exclusive atomic baseline writes. Targeted baseline, command and engine tests: 23 passed, including a non-git tracker subprocess with no git executable. Typecheck and lint passed. Baseline mode gates new findings at every severity; ordinary lint retains its existing threshold behavior."
  "2026-10-21T20:17:08.204Z",codex-agent,"Public validation: committed public pm-ops tracker at eba7d5262fd75e67afce0caad29dae7dc7dfbaeb, read-only non-git snapshot, 146 certified/scanned items, 24 findings (10 PML002 errors, 10 PML005 warnings, 4 PML006 info). Exact acknowledgments retained 24 debt, 0 new/stale, exit 0. Separate mutation copy: 23 debt, 1 new, 1 stale, exit 1; broad disabling refused. Snapshot byte inventory unchanged. Behavioral revert proof: replacing sourceDigest, isAcknowledged and assertBaselinePolicy with non-enforcing behavior made all 3 selected regressions fail; restored immediately. Command: node --test --test-name-pattern \"source digest|baseline retains|baseline refuses\" test/baseline.test.ts. No SDK mocks; disk-write fault injection tests atomic preservation."
  "2026-10-21T20:18:46.541Z",codex-agent,"Final targeted baseline coverage: 8 tests passed; baseline.ts and baseline-file.ts measured 100% statements, branches, functions and lines. Linked targeted suite passed 23/23 through pm test --run --progress (project test-result tracking is disabled, so the receipt is documented here). Fixed lock cleanup so a successful publisher cannot remove a subsequent writer lock. Source typecheck, lint, zero-duplication and docstring gates are being finalized; full npm/Bun gates are delegated to CI as requested. Local strict health reports merge_fence_drift after restoring the preexisting tracked fence changed by dependency prepare; no merge-driver work or history repair performed. CI uses its normal npm ci preparation."
  "2026-10-21T20:20:44.644Z",codex-agent,"PR #18 is ready for review: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/pull/18 at c3501f8d9c4e20895ae25caea180d967bb333da9. CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39669360702. Both Node 22/26 jobs have passed typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and full coverage; packed npm/Bun acceptance and the Node 26 Bun release gate are running. Linked pm suite plus typecheck and lint passed (3/3 linked commands; 23 targeted tests). Published PR body verified for private-path policy. GitHub GraphQL quota was exhausted, so PR creation used the available REST API after gh pr create refused."
  "2026-10-21T20:23:08.672Z",codex-agent,"Full CI passed at c3501f8d9c4e20895ae25caea180d967bb333da9: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39669360702. Node 22 and Node 26 npm gate sequences each passed 86 suite tests plus 1 packed acceptance test; Node 26 bun run release:check passed another 86 plus 1 packed acceptance. Each full coverage run reported all 17 required source files at 100/100/100/100; 47 documented declarations and zero duplication. Normal CI health passed in both jobs. Packed acceptance covers npm/npx and native Bun/bunx baseline acknowledgment, retained debt and new failures. Implementation complete; item remains in_progress for orchestrator verification. Releasing work claim with this evidence-only handoff commit; final-head CI will be verified and recorded in the PR before stopping. No merge, package release or tracker closure."
  "2026-10-21T21:45:45.653Z",codex-agent,"Review round: all three unresolved CodeRabbit findings verified against the code; latest review has no Outside diff range or nitpick sections. Plan: sync the lock before replacement and verify sync failure preserves old bytes; resolve the subprocess SDK through its public export and exercise relocated exports using the real SDK; exclude self-resolving stale-work findings from the public probe with an adversarial non-git tracker regression. Branch is current and includes main. Full npm/Bun gates stay in CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-21T21:47:36.085Z",codex-agent,"Verified unresolved threads PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc6u9frx, PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc6u9fr8 and PRRT_kwDOVHTnEc6u9fsE; all valid. Added sync-before-close/rename plus complete-byte and sync-error preservation regression; changed child SDK import to import.meta.resolve of the public export with a transparent relocated-export facade using the real PmClient; excluded PML005 as well as PML008 from the mutation probe, exercised with an older stale-only item ordered before persistent missing-criteria debt. Full PR self-review found no other production writers, private SDK imports or self-resolving probe selectors requiring changes. No outside-diff findings or additional nitpick section in latest CodeRabbit review. Targeted regressions 3/3; npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed."
  "2026-10-21T21:47:38.294Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proofs, each changing only its fix while retaining regression assertions: (1) removing lock.sync from publishBaseline: node --test --test-name-pattern \"baseline publication syncs\" test/baseline.test.ts failed 0/1, expected 1 sync call but observed 0; (2) reverting only the generated SDK import to the private path: node --test --test-name-pattern \"new baseline SDK\" test/baseline.test.ts failed 0/1, public-sdk-export-loaded marker absent; (3) reverting only the probe selector to permit PML005: node --test --test-name-pattern \"public validation skips\" test/baseline.test.ts failed 0/1 at changed.new_count > 0. Every fix restored immediately. With all fixes present the same three tests pass 3/3. Tests use real isolated non-git trackers; only file-sync fault injection and module-resolution relocation are instrumented, with no SDK mocks."
  "2026-10-21T21:48:08.078Z",codex-agent,"Linked verification: pm test pm-lint-lint-baselines --run --only-last --progress passed 1/1 selected command, reporting 3 tests passed, zero failed/skipped/cancelled. The preexisting project setting disables persisted test-result recording, so this comment preserves the receipt. Typecheck and lint passed locally; no local timeout occurred. No dist files are tracked. Full release gate evidence will come from Node 22/26 npm CI and Node 26 bun run release:check, without threshold or dependency changes."
  "2026-10-21T21:51:18.169Z",codex-agent,"First review-fix CI at f0ad9f5 stopped in both Node jobs at the zero-duplication gate: test/baseline.test.ts duplicated three acknowledgment-setup lines (one clone pair; 3/3667 duplicated lines). CI run: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39681732550. Extracted a shared evidence-request helper used by both real-tracker tests. Threshold remains zero; no production behavior changed. Re-running the targeted regressions, typecheck and lint before the next CI run."
  "2026-10-21T21:51:34.065Z",codex-agent,"After extracting the shared request helper: linked targeted regressions passed 3/3 again; npm run typecheck and npm run lint passed. The three behavioral revert proofs remain applicable because only duplicate fixture setup changed. Sending the corrected test fixture through the unchanged full CI gates."
  "2026-10-21T21:55:42.562Z",codex-agent,"Corrected review-fix head a37d1a7f67336169acb5169c77740e06773b279e passed full CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-lint/actions/runs/39682138915. Node 22 and Node 26 npm gate sequences each passed 88 suite tests plus 1 packed acceptance test; Node 26 bun run release:check passed another 88 suite tests plus 1 packed acceptance test. Every outer suite had zero failed, skipped or cancelled tests. Each of three coverage evaluations measured 17 required source files at 100% statements, branches, functions and lines at unchanged thresholds. Duplication 0% (0/3671 lines; zero clone pairs); docstrings 47 declarations across 17 files. CI tracker health passed in both jobs; CodeQL passed. Initial duplication-gate failure was corrected by the shared fixture helper, with no lowered gate. No local timeout, new pm CLI/SDK defect, unresolved implementation risk or out-of-scope discovery. Test-result recording remains disabled by existing policy; receipts are preserved in comments. Releasing the claim and leaving the item in_progress for orchestrator verification. Final evidence-only head CI will be checked and linked in the PR summary before stopping."
